---
name: known_food_location
description: >
  Campus-wide (not proximity-gated) counterpart to nearby_affordances_line's
  dining hint (#931 follow-up): nearby_affordances_line only names a dining
  arena already within the character's vision_r, so a hungry agent far from
  Houston Hall had no way to know where to travel until it happened to wander
  into view. Rendered by cognition.known_food_location_line() and appended
  only when the character is actually is_low_energy ("hungry") -- an
  actionable answer to "where do I go", not a standing campus directory in
  every observation.
inputs:
  places:
    type: string
    description: >
      Pre-joined "<name> (<tags>)" fragments for every dining/marketplace
      location in the game, regardless of distance, e.g.
      "Houston Hall (dining, marketplace)".
sample:
  places: "Houston Hall (dining, marketplace)"
---
Even if it isn't nearby, you know food can be found at: {{ places }}.
